---
import SavAlbum from '../components/SavAlbum.astro';
import '@fontsource-variable/fraunces';
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import '@fontsource/courier-prime/400.css';
import '../styles/global.css';

---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="description" content="A little something for Savindi, with love from Akil." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f2e9" />
    <title>Happy one month, Savindi ♡</title>
  </head>
  <body class="anniversary">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#letter">Skip to the letter</a>
    <main>
      <header class="dedication"><span>A little something for Savindi</span><span aria-hidden="true">A + S</span></header>
      <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="anniversary-title">
        <p class="occasion">Our first month</p>
        <h1 id="anniversary-title">Happy one month,<br /><em>Savindi.</em></h1>
        <p class="opening-note">I wanted to make you something.<br />So I made a little place here, for you.</p>
        <div class="bouquet" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 460" fill="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="lily-petal-color" x1="284" y1="55" x2="300" y2="190" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#c78570"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#b85e57"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#81354b"/></linearGradient>
              <path id="lily-petal" d="M300 190C282 157 239 123 247 86C252 62 275 49 295 58C275 61 269 76 277 95C288 121 321 151 300 190Z"/>
            </defs>
            <path d="M111 330V205a189 189 0 0 1 378 0v125" stroke="#d7bfb0" stroke-dasharray="2 7"/>
            <g class="flower lily" style="--turn:-5deg;transform-origin:295px 410px">
              <path d="M295 417C280 354 327 290 300 183" stroke="#607553" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M297 354C267 321 220 337 201 300C245 294 282 312 297 354Z" fill="#8b9a77"/>
              <path d="M304 304C321 271 369 276 390 245C347 245 315 266 304 304Z" fill="#6e835e"/>
              <path d="M290 387C272 369 246 375 226 355C257 352 281 367 290 387Z" fill="#9ca889"/>
              <g class="blossom" style="transform-origin:300px 190px">
                {[180,240,300,0,60,120].map((angle,i)=><g transform={`rotate(${angle} 300 190)`}>
                  <use href="#lily-petal" fill="url(#lily-petal-color)" stroke="#934455" stroke-width=".7" opacity={i<3 ? '.88' : '1'}/>
                  <path d="M298 180Q280 132 265 93" stroke="#e7b39a" stroke-width="1" opacity=".65"/>
                  {[[288,154,2],[277,140,2.2],[287,134,1.5],[269,122,1.7],[278,117,1.9],[263,106,1.3],[291,164,1.6]].map(([x,y,r])=><ellipse cx={x} cy={y} rx={r} ry={r*1.4} fill="#622d3c"/>)}
                </g>)}
                <g stroke="#dbbc90" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round">
                  <path d="M300 191Q274 161 273 144M300 191Q312 152 327 140M300 191Q338 180 348 162M300 191Q275 198 260 185M300 191Q315 210 340 200"/>
                </g>
                <g fill="#61352e"><ellipse cx="273" cy="142" rx="3" ry="7" transform="rotate(-25 273 142)"/><ellipse cx="329" cy="139" rx="3" ry="7" transform="rotate(30 329 139)"/><ellipse cx="350" cy="161" rx="3" ry="7" transform="rotate(45 350 161)"/><ellipse cx="258" cy="185" rx="7" ry="3"/><ellipse cx="342" cy="200" rx="7" ry="3"/></g>
                <path d="M300 191Q304 167 302 153" stroke="#8e9b70" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="302" cy="151" r="3" fill="#a9b38a"/>
              </g>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="tiny-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
      </section>
      <section class="letter-section" id="letter" aria-label="A letter for Savindi">
        <details class="letter">
          <summary><span class="envelope-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="envelope-flap"></span><span class="seal">♡</span></span><span class="letter-label">For you, with love <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></summary>
          <div class="letter-paper">
            <p class="salutation">My Savi,</p>
            <p>Happy one month, Savi.</p>
            <p>I really didn’t expect things to go this way when I was looking for matches on Tinder. But a few months after we matched, and one month into officially being together, you’ve made me feel so much love and affection. It honestly feels like someone answered prayers and wishes I never even made in the first place. Lucky me.</p>
            <p>I wanted to write you a little something for our first month. I love spending time with you, and I wanted to put into words some of the things that have made being with you feel so good.</p>
            <p>Our trip to Hiriketiya is a pretty good place to start. I had such a nice time with you. We ate so much pizza and it was so good. You were so hyped to get into the ocean, but then you got scared of the waves and ran back, almost falling over when one hit you. You’re so cute. There’s no one else I would rather have gone on that trip with.</p>
            <p>And on the bus back to Colombo, when you had your head on my shoulder, I felt so content. I don’t really know how else to put it. That’s such a rare feeling to have with someone. I’m so glad I get to have it with you.</p>
            <p>Even before that trip, I loved going to the museum with you, and to the planetarium on another day. I just loved getting to share those experiences with you. Your company and just talking with you feel so amazing. I feel so lucky that I get to feel that way about someone, and that it’s you.</p>
            <p>Another thing I can still picture so clearly is us sitting next to each other in my room, with your legs on my lap, watching a movie and eating Dinemore submarines. You looked so cute in my T-shirt. I can still vividly picture you sitting there.</p>
            <p>I love how you’ve so effortlessly made your way into my heart, and my space, and the things I do. It all feels so natural. Being your boyfriend feels so easy. I feel like I can just be myself with you and really connect with you, and that means so much to me.</p>
            <p>I’m so glad you’re a part of my world, Savi. <span aria-hidden="true">🐚</span></p>
            <p>I love you, Savi. I’m really happy it’s you.</p>
            <p class="signature">Yours,<br /><span>Akil</span><span class="signature-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span></p>
            <p class="postscript">P.S. I also really like your cute butt.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
      <SavAlbum />
      <footer><p>One month with you.</p><span>And I’m looking forward to the next.</span><div aria-hidden="true">A <i>♡</i> S</div></footer>
    </main>
    <script>
      const reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
      const bouquet = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.bouquet');
      bouquet?.addEventListener('pointermove', event => {
        if (reduced.matches || event.pointerType !== 'mouse') return;
        const rect = bouquet.getBoundingClientRect();
        bouquet.style.setProperty('--sway', `${((event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width - .5) * 5}deg`);
      });
      bouquet?.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => bouquet.style.setProperty('--sway', '0deg'));
      reduced.addEventListener('change', () => bouquet?.style.setProperty('--sway', '0deg'));
      const letter = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('.letter');
      letter?.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
        if (!letter.open || reduced.matches) return;
        letter.querySelector('.letter-paper')?.animate([{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(12px)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0)' }], { duration: 500, easing: 'ease-out' });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
:global(body.anniversary) { color-scheme:light;--paper:#f8f2e9;--ink:#443b36;--ink-muted:#78675e;--accent:#86384f;--accent-deep:#6e293e;--accent-tint:#ecdbd8;--rule:#ddcbbd;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink); }
main { max-width:1060px;margin:auto;padding:0 clamp(1.25rem,5vw,4rem); }.dedication { display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding-block:1.8rem;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-muted); }.dedication span:last-child { color:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap; }.opening { text-align:center;position:relative;padding-top:5rem; }.occasion { text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.2em;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:2rem; }h1 { font:400 clamp(3.2rem,7.7vw,6.2rem)/1.06 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.055em; }h1 em { font-weight:400;color:var(--accent); }.opening-note { margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.7vw,1.05rem);line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-muted); }.bouquet { max-width:600px;margin:1.5rem auto 0; }.flower { transform:rotate(calc(var(--turn) + var(--sway,0deg)));transition:transform .8s ease-out; }.blossom { transition:transform .5s; }.flower:hover .blossom { transform:scale(1.08); }.tiny-heart { display:block;font:2rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);margin-top:-1rem; }
.letter-section { max-width:620px;margin:4rem auto 0;scroll-margin-top:2rem; }.letter summary { cursor:pointer;list-style:none;text-align:center;padding:1rem; }.letter summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }.envelope-art { display:block;position:relative;width:220px;height:135px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;background:#eddfd0;border:1px solid #c9ac98;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #71543c10;transform:rotate(-4deg);transition:transform .4s;overflow:hidden; }.envelope-art::before,.envelope-art::after { content:'';position:absolute;width:155px;height:155px;border:1px solid #c9ac98;transform:rotate(45deg);top:58px;background:#f1e5d7; }.envelope-art::before { left:-80px; }.envelope-art::after { right:-80px; }.envelope-flap { position:absolute;width:160px;height:160px;transform:rotate(45deg);top:-105px;left:29px;border:1px solid #c9ac98;background:#f3e8db; }.seal { display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;position:absolute;top:44px;left:90px;border-radius:50%;background:#85384e;color:#f8e8e0;z-index:1;font-size:1.4rem;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #ffffff15; }.letter summary:hover .envelope-art,.letter summary:focus-visible .envelope-art { transform:rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px); }.letter[open] .envelope-art { transform:rotate(3deg); }.letter-label { font:.7rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent); }.letter-label>span { display:inline-block;margin-left:.5rem; }.letter-paper { background:#fffaf3;margin-top:2rem;padding:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,3.5rem);border:1px solid var(--rule);box-shadow:0 15px 45px #67482e08;position:relative; }.letter-paper::before { content:'';position:absolute;inset:.6rem;border:1px solid #e8d9cc;pointer-events:none; }.letter-paper p { font-size:1rem;line-height:1.95;margin-top:1.4rem; }.letter-paper .salutation { font:italic 1.9rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);margin-top:0; }.letter-paper .postscript { font-size:.9rem;color:var(--accent); }.signature { position:relative; }.signature>span:not(.signature-heart) { font:italic 2.5rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent); }.signature-heart { float:right;font-size:2rem;color:var(--accent); }
footer { padding:5rem 0 3rem;text-align:center; }footer>p { font:400 clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.5rem) var(--font-display); }footer>span { display:block;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:.7rem; }footer>div { margin-top:3rem;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.2em; }footer i { font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);padding-inline:.5rem; }
@media(max-width:600px) { .opening { padding-top:3rem; }.occasion { margin-bottom:1.5rem; }.bouquet { margin-top:2rem; }.letter-section { margin-top:2.5rem; }.dedication { font-size:.58rem;padding-block:1.4rem; } }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .flower { transform:rotate(var(--turn)) !important; }.flower:hover .blossom { transform:none; }.letter summary:hover .envelope-art,.letter summary:focus-visible .envelope-art { transform:none; } }
</style>
